    "# Brent Oil Price Forecasting: 10-Trading-Day Horizon\n",
    "### QF5210 Financial Time Series\n",
    "\n",
    "Statistical and machine-learning forecasts of Brent spot prices are compared using a revised historical split: **2024–2025 for validation** and **January–September 2026 for testing**. Forecast accuracy, direction, economic performance and uncertainty are assessed against random walk and historical mean.\n",
    "\n",
    "The selected specification minimises validation MAPE, subject to a simplicity tie-break. It is fixed before test evaluation. The final section compares this model with both benchmarks over the test period. The archived source-data snapshot is held constant so that changes from the earlier study reflect the revised evaluation design."
   ]
  },
